      "title_hint": "产品品名详解",
      "content": "{\"title\": \"产品品名详解\", \"template\": \"cn\", \"tbody_html\": \"<tr><td>1</td><td>敏感产品</td><td><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">纯液体类、带液体类、膏体类、油性类产品；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">全新内存卡；化妆品类；永生花；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">宠物口粮、宠物用品颗粒类；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">成人用品类；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">动漫手办类；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">带雪种的电器类；如空调、冰箱等；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">非临床医疗器械类，如美容仪器、美容床等；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">无油无气的电动打火机；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">蜡烛类，如香薰蜡烛、大豆蜡；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">带酒精棉的产品，如手机膜；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">活性炭、碳粉、硒鼓、木炭；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">非管制刀具类，如西餐刀叉、水果刀；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">非药品但是含中药成分的理疗贴药膏，如艾草贴；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">内置颗粒状产品，如健身沙袋、含沙哑铃等；</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p></td><td class=\\\"sc-left\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size: 24px\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\\\"font-size: 24px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px\\\">3/kg</span></span></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 24px\\\"></span></td><td class=\\\"sc-channel-cell\\\" rowspan=\\\"3\\\"><br></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>9类危险品电池产品</td><td><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">电池的功率单个超过20wh，电池组功率超过100wh都属于危险品：</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">Energy storage battery储能电池；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">Outdoor battery户外电池；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">Start power supply启动电源；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">power bank充电宝；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">Balanced vehicle平衡车；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">scooter滑板车；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">一切电池超功率产品；</span></p></td><td><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px\\\">5/kg</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>禁运产品</td><td><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">动物类，比如：鱼类，禽类 （活体），</span>动物皮毛；</p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">税票/税单；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">金条（或其他贵重金属），</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体\\\">珠宝，贵重晶石；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">难以估计价值的证券或文件，</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体\\\">银行卡、证件类产品；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">武器，弹药，仿真武器；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">遗体或骨灰；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">所有违法物品，</span>管制刀具<span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">古董，</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">石棉，</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt\\\">货币；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">IATA规定的危险品；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">仿牌，侵权产品；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">香烟，水烟膏，电子烟；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">粉末类产品，</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span>所有化工品；</p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">仿真儿童情趣玩偶；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">干花，</span>人造石<span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">胶囊、保健品等一切药物产品;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">机油、发动机专用油;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">国家限制的飞机模型、无人机；</span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">压片机；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">以燃油为动力的机器和车辆；</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\"></span></p><p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt\\\">含有针头类的机器，仪器，设备，注射器；</span></p></td><td><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px\\\">禁运产品</span></td></tr>\"}"
    },
